Package: com.xsxs18.purify
Name: Purify
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: A modern, smart system cleaner for rootless & roothide jailbreaks.
 Cleans caches, logs, temp files and package leftovers, manages tweaks and
 launch daemons, finds large files and orphaned packages, and schedules
 automatic cleaning – with a clean, AI-inspired interface.
Maintainer: xsxs18
Author: xsxs18
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
Recommends: uikittools
